#### Scene 하위 폴더 패턴

```
Bottom/{Feature}/
├── Common/               # 기능 공통 컴포넌트
├── {SubFeature}List/
│   ├── View/             # {SubFeature}ListViewController
│   └── ViewModel/        # {SubFeature}ListViewModel
├── {SubFeature}Detail/
│   ├── View/
│   └── ViewModel/
└── {SubFeature}Edit/
    ├── {Step}/           # Info, Style 등 편집 단계
    │   ├── View/
    │   └── ViewModel/
    └── ...
```

---

### Extension Layer

```
Extension/ (28개 파일)
├── Foundation:    Extension+String, +Int, +Double, +Date, +Locale
├── CoreLocation:  Extension+CLLocationCoordinate2D, +CLLocationDegrees
├── UIKit:         Extension+UIView, +UIButton, +UITextField, +UIColor,
│                  +UIImage, +UIViewController, +UITableView,
│                  +UICollectionView, +UIButtonConfiguration
├── Layout:        Extension+UIEdgeInsets, +NSDirectionalEdgeInsets, +CGSize, +CGFloat
├── RxSwift:       Extension+Rx, Reactive+UIView, +UIViewController, +UITableView
└── Utilities:     Extension+NSObject, +URL, +NotificationCenter
```

